Package: deadpool-tickets
Version: 1.0.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: prak05 <prak05@localhost>
Depends: xdg-utils
Recommends: python3-webview | chromium | firefox-esr | firefox
Description: Fan-made Deadpool & Wolverine ticket terminal
 A single-page, offline-capable ticket booking demo for the movie
 Deadpool & Wolverine. Opens in a standalone window via pywebview,
 a Chromium-family --app window, Firefox, or the default browser.
 .
 Fan project; no real tickets are sold. Not affiliated with Marvel or Disney.
